Seven-second live odds delay may have cost bookmakers ₺12m

Istanbul prosecutors are investigating an alleged scheme in which an employee of a sports data provider delayed live odds feeds by around seven seconds. Investigators say associates used the window to place bets after already knowing the actual score.

